+ │  - Pilot:   Translates K8s Gateway, VirtualService & DestinationRule CRDs into Envoy xDS dynamic APIs over gRPC    │
+ │  - Citadel: Acts as Internal Certificate Authority; delivers X.509 certs & SPIFFE IDs via SDS for mTLS            │
